# Option "Pentacle snaps": a candle put down near a point of Bane's pentacle
# goes onto it (here next to it: a thin wall stands on the point itself,
# 16 away still counts); a reagent put onto that candle goes right in
# front of it, towards the middle
args: --map 12 --pos 18540,15900,40
do: option:pentagram_snap,on;t5;sendto:21561,12,18560,15930,40;sendto:21569,12,18500,15950,40;t2
do: drag:21561:309,236;where:21561;drag:21569:319,238;where:21569
expect: where 21561: 18629,15992,40
expect: where 21569: 18661,15999,40
